<title>SOUTH AFRICA: WOOLTRU LTD RESTRUCTURING TO EXPAND ABROAD - REPORT.</title>
<headline>WOOLTRU LTD RESTRUCTURING TO EXPAND ABROAD - REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African retail group Wooltru Ltd is restructuring some of its interests in a bid to expand its overseas business, and will form a new company to aid the bid, Business Tonight reported.</p>
<p>The new company, Truworths International, would house its Truworths and Sport Girl chain, the report said. It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
